{"id":"rczuyu5n3wwvtcpeyuaganwa7","title":"Vestige DeFi 平台宣布 12 月 31 日停运","originalTitle":"DeFi平台Vestige将于12月31日停运","summary":"Vestige宣布将于12月31日关闭主站、API及交易聚合器服务，因Algorand生态交易量不足导致长期亏损。用户钱包资产不受影响，但存入金库的资产需通过旧版前端访问，平台将销毁全部VEST代币及流动性凭证。","reason":"用户需注意钱包资产与金库资产的区别，及时处理存入金库的资产","source":{"name":"PANews"},"links":{"original":"https://www.panewslab.com/zh/articles/01a1dc88-b00e-7770-89eb-7aeda51fe1b9"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-15T00:08:29.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-15T00:09:25.855Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-15T00:09:25.855Z","category":"crypto-defi","tags":["破产清算","DeFi"],"score":76,"selected":true,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"c2810ad5-48a8-4296-bae8-1d218014bd1f","title":"Vestige DeFi平台因Algorand生态交易不足宣布停运并分阶段销毁VEST代币"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"c2810ad5-48a8-4296-bae8-1d218014bd1f","title":"Vestige DeFi平台因Algorand生态交易不足宣布停运并分阶段销毁VEST代币"}],"topics":[{"slug":"defi","name":"DeFi 与链上"},{"slug":"bankruptcy","name":"破产与清算"}],"indexable":true,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fZGiLSgyVETo","reportCount":2,"additionalSourceCount":1},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}